# Files the Vercel CLI must never upload.
#
# Without this file, `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory, and a
# local .env.local containing the Supabase service role key, the Resend key
# and the admin session secret would go with it. Git pushes are the normal
# deploy path and never carry these; this exists so a manual CLI deploy —
# the fallback when the Git integration does not fire — is equally safe.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
node_modules
.next
.screenshots
.lighthouse
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
supabase/.temp
